Vendored inference modules from FunASR (`funasr/models/emotion2vec/`, MIT)
and Facebook fairseq / data2vec-style blocks (MIT).

https://github.com/modelscope/FunASR
https://github.com/ddlBoJack/emotion2vec

This package is used only to load a local emotion2vec+ checkpoint with
PyTorch. Do not install the FunASR or ModelScope Python packages for SER.
